# wallet/ is excluded from git (.gitignore -- never publish it, it's mTLS
# cert material) but MUST reach the FastAPI Cloud deploy bundle (see
# app/db/engine.py's wallet connection). The deploy CLI is .gitignore-aware
# (rignore/the Rust "ignore" crate), so once this became a real git repo,
# .gitignore's "wallet/" line started silently excluding it here too --
# negate it explicitly so it's re-included despite that.
!wallet/
!wallet/**
